    "snippet": "* Rain and storm chances return Saturday afternoon and Sunday as monsoonal moisture surges northward * Drier conditions for Labor Day, monsoonal moisture and warmer temperatures may return mid next week. While the southwesterly flow pattern will keep conditions relatively dry through the desert southwest as monsoonal moisture remains shunted to the south...Saturday afternoon into Sunday look to be the exception as tropical moisture is drawn northward from the East Pacific.",
